### [1] presigned URL 발급 (프론트에서 S3 직접 업로드용)
POST http://localhost:3000/presigned-url
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "test.jpg",
  "fileType": "image/jpeg"
}

### [2] presigned URL로 S3에 직접 업로드 (PUT, curl 등으로)
# curl -X PUT "{url}" -H "Content-Type: image/jpeg" --data-binary @./test.jpg

### [3] presigned URL 방식 게시글 생성 (S3 URL만 전달)
POST http://localhost:3000/article
Authorization: Bearer ..kPeMr979CtyLtqtFvvUE9BslDGbRtdLI61d5Iy7UWXg.eyJpZCI6MiwiZW1haWwiOiJiamx5ZW9uMkBuYXZlci5jb20iLCJuYW1lIjoi7YWM7Iqk7Yq47Jyg7KCAOSIsImlhdCI6MTc1MTI2ODg5NywiZXhwIjoxNzUxMjcyNDk3fQ.PYinWZWcrFB3LuPqjycHtiJQx--g06IGWoETbeDkL1Y
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "presigned 게시글 제목",
  "content": "presigned 게시글 내용입니다.",
  "image": "https://버킷명.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/article/123456_test.jpg"
}

### [4] multer-s3 방식 게시글 생성 (서버가 S3에 직접 업로드)
# 실제로는 서버에서 multer-s3 미들웨어가 동작해야 함
POST http://localhost:3000/article?access=private
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MiwiZW1haWwiOiJiamx5ZW9uMkBuYXZlci5jb20iLCJuYW1lIjoi7YWM7Iqk7Yq47Jyg7KCAOSIsImlhdCI6MTc1MTI3MjgwMywiZXhwIjoxNzUxMjc2NDAzfQ.kPeMr979CtyLtqtFvvUE9BslDGbRtdLI61d5Iy7UWXg
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

multer-s3 게시글 제목
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

multer-s3 게시글 내용입니다.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### [5] 로컬 multer 방식 게시글 생성 (서버에 파일 저장)
